{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111652","id":2914712871,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6tuv0n","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111652","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111652.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111652.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111652","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111652/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111652/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111652/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/b49aea89d066071272edd0d4e7bb7765a7425dbe","number":111652,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Organize render surface sorting key for optimizing API performance.","user":{"login":"DarioSamo","id":538504,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzODUwNA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/538504?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo","html_url":"https://github.com/DarioSamo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"The reasoning behind this PR goes back to the comment I posted here.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111054#issuecomment-3402267616\r\n\r\n> The reason behind material_id and shader_id being the MSB of the bitfield is that it allows the renderer to sort and group based on being able to avoid rebinding pipelines and materials as much as possible. By inverting their order on the keys, other less significant elements have now been prioritized and the possibilities of batching together compatible draw calls has been reduced.\r\n> \r\n>     Shaders can be often reused because BaseMaterial3D will assign the same shaders to materials if their configuration is similar, which means only textures must be rebound if groups of draw calls with the same.\r\n>     Grouping materials avoids the need to rebind textures.\r\n>     Grouping geometry avoids the need to rebind vertex and index buffers.\r\n\r\nThe PR caused a performance regression by increasing in about 6% the amount of API calls. I added some basic printing to the Render Graph to verify this and got the following results in a large project.\r\n\r\n`master`: Draw list 712476 bytes\r\n`opaque-list-key`: Draw list **669220 bytes**\r\n\r\nThe draw list is the internal command buffer we use on the render graph before calling the underlying API, so measuring a reduction there scales quite linearly to the amount of commands that are called.\r\n\r\nI've also added a comment explaining the reasoning behind the ordering of the key so further changes to it are made with the performance impact in mind.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},